message: "If you use this code, please cite the article and this software archive."
title: "klosa-charls-no-helper: reproduction code for a KLoSA-CHARLS comparison of older adults with care needs and no helper"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/y3korea/klosa-charls-no-helper"
authors:
