keywords:
  - functional limitation
  - personal assistance
  - care poverty
  - long-term care
  - KLoSA
  - CHARLS
  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  Python (Supplementary Code S2) and R (Supplementary Code S1) code that recomputes, from the
  original KLoSA and CHARLS files, every value reported in the article "Older adults with care
  needs and no helper in South Korea and China, 2013-2020: how measurement shapes the comparison",
  with aggregate outputs of a run on both surveys. No survey data are included.
